The other reports of the same runs pair `create_request()` (L706/L707) with itself on two receive threads, and `TypeLookupReplyListener::process_reply()` (TypeLookupReplyListener.cpp:106) with `add_async_get_type_request()` (TypeLookupManager.cpp:469).

### Network traffic capture

Not applicable: single host, and the races are inside one process.
